{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1178957-ooc-mangham-high-school-teens-really-are-monsters","id":1178957,"title":"[OOC] Mangham High School: Teens really are monsters","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-01-24T15:00:07-08:00","id":1178957,"title":"[OOC] Mangham High School: Teens really are monsters","content":"Mangham, a small coastal georgia town, just close enough to Savannah for an easy commute, far enough to get away from the crime. With an economy based on tourism and the military, this small town is supposed to be great place to grow up... for a mortal that is. For a teenage monster, things will of course be more complicated. With adults keeping secrets, the other teenage monsters trying to recruit you for their bullshit, the rivalry with the other other teenage monsters at Frank Darabont Memorial High )your rivals) who want you dead and the down right weird shit happening on a regular basis, it seems Mangham has more to it than meets the eye. And that is where things stand when a group of teenage monsters, and one hunter at Mangham High School all wind up in detention together almost as soon as school starts in August. ..<br /> <br /> Think Riverdale meets Gravity falls, but in Georgia.<br /> <br /> <br /> Player List<br /> <br /> <br /> Afj = Obrimos mage<br /> <br /> ElvesofZion = Messenger demon<br /> <br /> spencer = Netzo hunter<br /> <br /> Malonkey = Cahalith werewolf<br /> <br /> Cinder = Eshmaki Ravager<br /> <br /> reaperfrost = stricken sin eater<br /> <br /> Knowbody = acanthus mage<br /> <br /> <br /> So the first thing I want you guys to do before we get started, once you finish making your characters, is come up with what y'all did to wind up in detention together, Breakfast Club style.<br /> <br /> be sure to post your stats, background and such","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 01-24-2018, 07:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T15:53:07-08:00","id":1178979,"title":"","content":"I think I'm going with the Cahalith werewolf. He ended up in detention when he fought back against a bully. Character sheet will be linked soon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T16:30:19-08:00","id":1178993,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1178957-ooc-mangham-high-school-teens-really-are-monsters?p=1178979#post1178979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think I'm going with the Cahalith werewolf. He ended up in detention when he fought back against a bully. Character sheet will be linked soon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Anything left of the bully?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T16:36:35-08:00","id":1178996,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1178957-ooc-mangham-high-school-teens-really-are-monsters?p=1178993#post1178993\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Anything left of the bully?</div> </div> </div> </div>The bully's nose is broken. Roger is pretty gentle, usually. He only went that far because the backpack had his dad's army uniform in it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T17:18:50-08:00","id":1179018,"title":"","content":"After thinking of the background, I decided to go with Anakim. It works with the physicality that kept coming up in my mental image and the hopelessness of &quot;you'll turn up rotten as those of your family do no matter what&quot;.<br /> <br /> Name's Sam. Detention might involve a rock, a teacher's car and an impulsive use of Cyclopean Strength. Gonna write him up tomorrow morning (sorry about that, but it's pretty late around here)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 01-24-2018, 08:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T17:30:53-08:00","id":1179023,"title":"","content":"Just finished writing up my sin eaters back story now I am thinking about his geist. His names gonna be Alden reason for detention is gonna have to involve him enjoying boxing a little to much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T19:56:32-08:00","id":1179066,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://twentytwowords.com/hilarious-reasons-kids-were-given-detention/\" target=\"_blank\">http://twentytwowords.com/hilarious-...ven-detention/</a> got some ideas for what got him into detention.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":893,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","user":"reaperfrost8","date":". 01-24-2018, 11:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T21:07:57-08:00","id":1179093,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1m_u6JPrhQwQ5wSL89I6HUnkqOlC9VlxY26CpqMO73Ks/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1m_u6JPrhQwQ5wSL89I6HUnkqOlC9VlxY26CpqMO73Ks/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1m_u6JPrhQwQ5wSL89I6HUnkqOlC9VlxY26CpqMO73Ks/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1m_u6JPrhQwQ5wSL89I6HUnkqOlC9VlxY26CpqMO73Ks/edit?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Here is Eli! I statted him out and made his lore!<br /> <br /> first of all i cant wait for this character to be really not as powerful as anyone else by a long shot with their regular ass human abilities (he's not even a sleepwalker so lunacy and paradox and Quintessence ahoy) and mere human 7 merit dots.<br /> <br /> Second of all could people please look over my lore and stats to make sure I didn't mess something up or do something dumb or make lore that sticks out like a sore thumb or something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","name":"SdeSpencer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T21:10:07-08:00","id":1179094,"title":"","content":"He went to detention for bringing a metal baseball bat to school. he didn't know it was against the rules. he brought it for self defence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","name":"SdeSpencer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T21:37:20-08:00","id":1179102,"title":"","content":"Took me a while to think of his geist feel free to criticize<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Name: Alden Santos<br /> Virtue: Calm</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Vice:Masochistic </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Archetype: Mourner</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Geist: Pale Sister</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Threshold: Stricken</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Willpower: 5</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Psyche: 1</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Synergy: 7</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Health:8 </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Keystone memento: Music Player</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Intelligence: 2 </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Strength: 3 </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Presence: 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Wits: 2 </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Dexterity: 2 </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Manipulation: 2</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Resolve: 3 </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Stamina: 3 </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Composure: 2</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Skills</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Academics:2 Medicine(Disease):1 Occult (Ghosts):3 Science: 1</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Athletics (Endurance): 4 Brawl: 3 Stealth: 2 Survival 1 Weaponry: 1</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Empathy:1 Persuasion: 2 Subterfuge: 1</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Merits: Indomitable: 2 Tolerance for Biology: 1 Iron will: 2 Boxing: 2 Eye for the Strange: 2</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Keys:Grave Dirt, Phantasmal Manifestations: Caul: 2 Rage: 1 Ceremonies:Pass on: 1</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Background: Alden was a normal thirteen year old during the time of his Bargain. Like any normal family he would always get a flu shot every year but during this year his family opted not to seeing as he looked healthy already or that he never had a cold or disease since he was six. The next thing they knew he was in the ER. As he was surrounded by doctors trying to heal him he was saved by an angel in the form of the Pale sister who made a deal with the wayward teen. \u201cTake me with you let me have the childhood I never experienced.\u201d Hearing the terms of the deal the teen accepted the deal becoming one of the bound.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Waking up from that hospital Alden became apathetic to life. His emotion dulled when he died while he still has some form of. His family considered to send him to therapy but opted not to thinking that this was a phase that will wear off at some point. All the while his \u201cSister\u201d is also trying to wake him from this apathy via trying to make him socialize or joining clubs hoping to get him more active in life not only for his sake but for her enjoyment so far the closest thing that's working is the boxing club.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Geist: The pale child was only but a child when she died her skin has become pale, eyes yellow and dull her clothes look dirty and ragged.Born during the time Europeans went to America It took her a century before she became a Geist thinking to use it as a way to get back to life she searches for the dying young hoping to receive a full childhood as well as piggy back ride to the true afterlife.</span></span><br /> <br /> Aspirations <br /> Long Term: Finish first semester with a gpa of 4.0<br /> Short Term: Make new friends<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> His reason for detention is that during boxing practice he wasn't paying attention and accidentally stepped on someone during push ups.<br /> <br /> Parents; Joshua Santos and Lilly Santos.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":893,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","user":"reaperfrost8","date":". 01-27-2018, 12:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-24T23:51:00-08:00","id":1179128,"title":"","content":"I'll get the writeup of James 'Achilles' Gardner out sometime later today. As for why he's in detention, it's probably for not paying attention in classes. He's one of those people that really works for the things he cares about and really doesn't give a shit about those he doesn't. In this case, 'what he cares about' is track and field and what he doesn't is 'most of the rest of the curriculum'.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T05:19:20-08:00","id":1179157,"title":"","content":"Ok, here's my new friend. Comments or questions are welcome<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Name:</b> Sam Boone</span></span><br /> <b>Legend:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Wrathful</span></span><br /> <b>Life: </b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Loyal</span></span><br /> <b>Family:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Anakim</span></span><br /> <b>Hunger: </b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ruin</span></span><br /> <b>Horror: </b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Rampaging Boar </span></span><br /> <b>Mental Attributes:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Intelligence 2, Wits 2, Resolve 2</span></span><br /> <b>Physical Attributes: </b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Strength 3, Dexterity 2, Stamina 3</span></span><br /> <b>Social Attributes:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Presence 2, Manipulation 2, Composure 3</span></span><br /> <b>Mental Skills:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Academics 1 (Legends), Crafts 2, Medicine 1 , Occult 1</span></span><br /> <b>Physical Skills:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Athletics 3 (Lifting), Brawl 4 (Multiple Opponents), Firearms 1, Larceny 2, Weaponry 1</span></span><br /> <b>Social Skills: </b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Intimidation 3, Streetwise 2, Subterfuge 2, Survival 1</span></span><br /> <b>Merits:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Encyclopedic Knowledge (Academics), Fame 1, Giant, Iron Skin 1, Relentless Assault 1, Striking Looks 2</span></span><br /> <b>Willpower: </b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">5</span></span><br /> <b>Lair:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> 1 (Undergrowth, Rotting)</span></span><br /> <b>Atavisms:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Cyclopean Strength, Relentless Hunter</span></span><br /> <b>Nightmares: </b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Everything You Do Is Worthless, Run Away</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Background:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sam had the bad luck to be born into a family filled with small criminals, thieves and troublemakers. While he rarely interacts with the worst elements of the Boone family (including his father, who has been in jail since Sam was a little kid), their reputation haunted Sam since childhood. This, combined with his somewhat intimidating appearance, made it so that too many of the adults in town always treated him as a lost cause, someone destined to end the same way as many of his relatives. This attitude left a mark over the time and a part of Sam has come to believe what others have told him so many times. Years of frustration and undeserved mistrust make it so that Sam has plenty of rage to vent, something that surfaces through tantrums and impulsive vandalism. The school has him listed as problematic student and most teachers treat him accordingly, but many would surprised to discover his grades are average and there\u2019s no heinous crime or act of bullism in his file. The truth is that most people are just afraid of him and treat him accordingly, something he\u2019s aware of. Too bad he has no idea how to make them change their mind (and has started to believe it\u2019s not worth trying)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Those who give Sam a chance discover that he\u2019s way more friendly and kind that his looks would suggest, but it will take some time and patience to get through all the defenses he had to raise over the years and go beyond a casual chat.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sam lives with his maternal grandparents. They told him that his mother left when he was a little kid, though there\u2019s a recurring gossip in town that Sam\u2019s father killed her. On his part, Sam refuses to think about her. His grandparents try to keep him away from all the Boone family, but Sam still visits some of the \u201cgood\u201d ones from time to time. At times, less than savory individuals, either family members or their associates, recognize and approach Sam. This led him into danger on many occasions, but he always managed to handle the situation.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sam\u2019s Devouring complicated things a lot. After weeks of unexplainable nightmares, the Devouring came out of nowhere in a heated summer night. It happened spontaneously, with no other Beast involved, but Sam could not deny the bond with the monstrous boar that rampaged through his dreams. The Devouring brought clarity to his life and now Sam feels like he found a missing piece of himself, but he has to deal with Hunger and his now-empowered wrath without any guidance. No other Begotten has approached him so far and Sam wonders if he\u2019s the only monster of his kind.</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Description: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sam is, to be blunt, huge. He\u2019s taller than all the other boys of his age (and many adults as well), to the point many take him as a grown-up man, and a rather big one to boot. Sam keeps his brown-reddish hair short, shaving them himself in an almost military cut. He often wears old, dismissed clothes of all sorts (as long as they fit), but his grandparents try to buy him some new ones for special occasion. He almost always wear a baseball hat when outside.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Some think Sam is slow-witted and shy, but that\u2019s only because he has almost nobody to talk with. He has his passions and a peculiar love for legends and fairytales that doubles as escapism. A bunch of people have mentioned that Sam might shine in certain sports, but nobody is willing to let him try. The general idea is that he\u2019s not worth the trouble.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sam\u2019s Horror is an immense, nightmarish boar. Its hide is covered in blood and pierced by dozens of arrows, spears and swords. Its Lair is a mountainous forest, with the ground littered by ancient weapons, armors and the bones of their owners. There\u2019s trace of old ruins and buildings here and there, but they all been destroyed and reclaimed by nature long ago. The environment is almost actively aggressive towards living creatures, as open wounds fester and life is drained by all intruders. Only the Boar itself is strong enough to endure here.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> <img src=\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ursBfGIrtq7i2ezVrx6LhemuXXB.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> </div></div> </div> </div></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 01-25-2018, 12:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T06:36:38-08:00","id":1179171,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1178957-ooc-mangham-high-school-teens-really-are-monsters?p=1179157#post1179157\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> <b>Name:</b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Sam Boone </span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>This is really cool! Also further brings out just how utterly screwed Eli is in this party so that's fun (It's fine really. Eli is a mini-antagonist already and has Tactics and Practical Experience and Risking Willpower and things like that)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","name":"SdeSpencer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T06:38:22-08:00","id":1179172,"title":"","content":"Hank &quot;Mjolnir&quot; Dixon took the blame when the kid sitting behind him kept talking during class and his clumsy attempts to protest only landed him in further trouble and detention. The little prick responsible apparently ended up with a broken nose later that day, so Hank feels pretty good about hexing him to balance the scales.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Name: Henry &quot;Hank&quot; Dixon<br /> Shadow Name: Mjolnir<br /> Path: Acanthus<br /> <br /> Virtue: Stubborn<br /> Vice: Reckless<br /> <br /> \u200bIntelligence: 1<br /> \u200bWits: 2<br /> \u200bResolve: 3<br /> Strength: 4<br /> Dexterity: 2<br /> Stamina: 3<br /> Presence: 3<br /> Manipulation: 1<br /> Composure: 3<br /> <br /> Skills: Crafts 1, Investigation 1, Medicine (first aid) 1, Occult 1, Athletics (throwing) 2, Brawl 2, Drive 3, Firearms 1, Weaponry 3, Expression 1, Intimidation 3, Streetwise 2, Subterfuge (play dumb) 1<br /> <br /> \u200bMerits: Artifact Hammer 6, Mentor 2, Hallow 2 (shared 4)<br /> <br /> Fate 2, Life 1, Prime 1, Time 2<br /> \u200bGnosis: 1<br /> Wisdom: 7<br /> Mana: 10<br /> <br /> Size: 5<br /> \u200bHealth: 8<br /> Willpower: 6<br /> Speed: 11<br /> Initiative: 5<br /> Defense: 4<br /> <br /> Background:<br /> \u200bHank Dixon is a white trash thug trying to turn his life around. His family have lived in and around Mangham pretty much as long as he can remember, and his younger sister Barbara attends the Middle School. Never especially bright, Hank's biggest failing throughout his life has been his tendency to follow others who didn't necessarily have his best interests at heart, earning the otherwise well-intentioned young man his unfortunate reputation as muscle for kids who are smarter and meaner than him. His Awakening to the Path of Thistle gave him a moment of clarity to shake free of his thorny past even as it landed him in juvenile hall. Now he's back in school for the new year and hoping to make sense of how his view of the world has changed.<br /> <br /> \u200bAppearance:<br /> \u200bHis formerly shaggy dark blonde hair has been trimmed into a buzz cut and he seems a bit more focused than before, but old habits die hard and his undefined muscular frame still makes an imposing first impression. He's still trying to define his Shadow persona; so far he tends to stand or sit up a bit straighter when shifting into &quot;wizard mode&quot; at least.<br /> <br /> Aspirations:<br /> Solve a problem without magic<br /> Stand up for yourself or others<br /> \u200bProve that you're not still the person you were.<br /> <br /> Obsession:<br /> Who will try to wield Mjolnir?<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> \u200bA couple questions: how much input do you want from players on things like the Mentor merit? And is there a school uniform? I seem to recall this being a private school at one point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":747,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","user":"Knowbody","date":".  Added Aspirations and Obsession 01-27-2018, 04:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T08:02:31-08:00","id":1179198,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knowbody</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1178957-ooc-mangham-high-school-teens-really-are-monsters?p=1179172#post1179172\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hank &quot;Mjolnir&quot; Dixon took the blame when the kid sitting behind him kept talking during class and his clumsy attempts to protest only landed him in further trouble and detention. The little prick responsible apparently ended up with a broken nose later that day, so Hank feels pretty good about hexing him to balance the scales.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Name: Henry &quot;Hank&quot; Dixon<br /> Shadow Name: Mjolnir<br /> Path: Acanthus<br /> <br /> Virtue: Stubborn<br /> Vice: Reckless<br /> <br /> \u200bIntelligence: 1<br /> \u200bWits: 2<br /> \u200bResolve: 3<br /> Strength: 4<br /> Dexterity: 2<br /> Stamina: 3<br /> Presence: 3<br /> Manipulation: 1<br /> Composure: 3<br /> <br /> Skills: Crafts 1, Investigation 1, Medicine (first aid) 1, Occult 1, Athletics (throwing) 2, Brawl 2, Drive 3, Firearms 1, Weaponry 3, Expression 1, Intimidation 3, Streetwise 2, Subterfuge (play dumb) 1<br /> <br /> \u200bMerits: Artifact Hammer 6, Mentor 2, Hallow 2 (shared 4)<br /> <br /> Fate 2, Life 1, Prime 1, Time 2<br /> \u200bGnosis: 1<br /> Wisdom: 7<br /> Mana: 10<br /> <br /> Size: 5<br /> \u200bHealth: 8<br /> Willpower: 6<br /> Speed: 11<br /> Initiative: 5<br /> Defense: 4<br /> <br /> Background:<br /> \u200bHank Dixon is a white trash thug trying to turn his life around. His family have lived in and around Mangham pretty much as long as he can remember, and his younger sister Barbara attends the Middle School. Never especially bright, Hank's biggest failing throughout his life has been his tendency to follow others who didn't necessarily have his best interests at heart, earning the otherwise well-intentioned young man his unfortunate reputation as muscle for kids who are smarter and meaner than him. His Awakening to the Path of Thistle gave him a moment of clarity to shake free of his thorny past even as it landed him in juvenile hall. Now he's back in school for the new year and hoping to make sense of how his view of the world has changed.<br /> <br /> \u200bAppearance:<br /> \u200bHis formerly shaggy dark blonde hair has been trimmed into a buzz cut and he seems a bit more focused than before, but old habits die hard and his undefined muscular frame still makes an imposing first impression. He's still trying to define his Shadow persona; so far he tends to stand or sit up a bit straighter when shifting into &quot;wizard mode&quot; at least.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> \u200bA couple questions: how much input do you want from players on things like the Mentor merit? And is there a school uniform? I seem to recall this being a private school at one point.</div> </div> </div> </div> I don\u2019t mind having input on the mentor just as long as they aren\u2019t part of one of the orders remember the social splats come into play later . I\u2019m thinking the school is a formerly private school that got seized by the state for... reasons but being in the Chatham county area means that the public schools have uniforms. The uniform for mangham high is a white button up shirt with a dark blue vest and khakis for boys . Some of the clubs have their own vests with different colors but all the vests have the school seal on the right breast.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 01-25-2018, 11:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","ran