ren't a problem.<br /> <br /> Gena and Ben Henson are the grandparents, the missing mom is Sharon and Anthony &quot;Tony&quot; Boone is the name of the dad. I'll let you pick the names for other relatives as needed.<br /> <br /> I'm afraid I'm a bit unfamiliar with how american schools work when it comes to classes. Is there such a thing as a &quot;standard curriculum&quot;?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T16:49:10-08:00","id":1179343,"title":"","content":"at least one class of each Social Studies, Science, English, and Math are required for every student. I don't know georgia specific rules, but where I live you also need at least one full credit of PE and 2 full credits of one foreign language where I live. (or computer science.) (credits are one full year of instruction usually). secondary question: is this just a typical public school or is this a magnet school/even potentially an early college school.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","name":"SdeSpencer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T16:50:56-08:00","id":1179345,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1178957-ooc-mangham-high-school-teens-really-are-monsters?p=1179339#post1179339\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Names aren't a problem.<br /> <br /> <br /> I'm afraid I'm a bit unfamiliar with how american schools work when it comes to classes. Is there such a thing as a &quot;standard curriculum&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>it's kind of complicated, just read <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secondary_education_in_the_United_States#Curriculum\" target=\"_blank\">this. </a> But more or less it is the individual districts that decide the curriculum, but the curriculums have to meet standards set by the states (in this case Georgia), with the federal government mostly involved via funding of certain programs as well as regulation and enforcement of constitutional rights.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T16:52:14-08:00","id":1179347,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SdeSpencer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1178957-ooc-mangham-high-school-teens-really-are-monsters?p=1179343#post1179343\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">at least one class of each Social Studies, Science, English, and Math are required for every student. I don't know georgia specific rules, but where I live you also need at least one full credit of PE and 2 full credits of one foreign language where I live. (or computer science.) (credits are one full year of instruction usually). secondary question: is this just a typical public school or is this a magnet school/even potentially an early college school.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah more or less this. And it is a public school, but it used to be a private school before the district took it over after a few... incidents.<br /> <br /> And Georgia also has a graduation test in four content areas. Georgia also doesn't require the language to graduate, but if you don't take it you will have to take it in college.<br /> <br /> and apparently the Chatham county graduation requirements are <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/a/chatham.k12.nc.us/chatham-county-schools-course-guide/course-guide-2014-2015/graduation-requirements\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 01-25-2018, 07:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T16:54:03-08:00","id":1179350,"title":"","content":"So is there a required grade for us or are we all starting out freshmen's.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":