onster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T15:52:29-07:00","id":1195011,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1178957-ooc-mangham-high-school-teens-really-are-monsters?p=1194990#post1194990\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">one more question before i try to finally get the game started, How do you know Cedric Holiday?</div> </div> </div> </div>Mostly just by reputation, never interacted much with him, random casual encounters aside. He always proved decent on those occasions and Sam's harbors no ill will to him, though he's puzzled by Cedric's seemingly carefree attitude (which is something alien to Sam). Sam actually hope's he's ok, even though that's a feeling born out of human decency more than an actual relationship with Cedric.<br /> <br /> Also, out of character, I'll agree with ElvesofZion and say that there's no issue with you taking all the time needed about this. Life's tough, no need to worry over this if you can avoid it, my friend. That said, if we manage to start and it's not a source of stress for you, I'll be excited about it for sure.<br /> <br /> tl; dr: if we start, it's cool. If you need time, it's cool. Whatever happens, it's cool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T16:50:45-07:00","id":1195032,"title":"","content":"I think some of Hank's old crew might have joked and talked smack about him among themselves, mostly just out of some resentment for his popularity, but they didn't really pick on Cedric like they did other kids. Maybe his offer to help tutor Hank in middle school was part of the reason he did well enough to graduate, which is something he keeps to himself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-13T19:34:04-07:00","id":1195082,"title":"","content":"What can Eli really say other than &quot;his reputation precedes him&quot;? Eli is very much the new kid in town and came in after Cedric left, so all he really knows of the guy is the gossip around the school, though the whole mystery of it all does lead to some bored idle speculation on Eli's part; though at this point Eli has been mostly just trying to not make a splash early in the school year.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13001-sdespencer","name":"SdeSpencer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13001_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-14T00:06:00-07:00","id":1195164,"title":"","content":"Kim doesn't really know much about the Cedric mostly on account that he is also a new kid coming to this school as well beyond while similar to Eli Kim doesn't pay much attention to school gossip seeing as well school gossip, though Kim has heard of him mostly from school and a small bit from his parents interacting with his parents specifically his mother. While he hasn't met Cedric he does hope that he would make a safe return home.<br /> <br /> Out of character as well I agree with cinder and zion take all the time you need real life takes priority/","signature":"","edited":{"userid":893,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","user":"reaperfrost8","date":". 03-14-2018, 03:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-14T00:35:16-07:00","id":1195173,"title":"","content":"I'm really sorry about this, but I think I'm going to have to withdraw myself fro